WEBVTT

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:06.870
Doi-kun!

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:16.940
Sensei?

00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:29.860
Doi-kun, I think you're smart... and strong!

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:41.520
Shouta-sama!

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.960
This is a hospital in Keimon City.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.650
How do you feel?

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:53.190
I'm okay.

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:57.700
I remember the explosion at the dorm, but...

00:00:58.970 --> 00:01:00.360
He's fine.

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.540
The injury on his back healed, as well.

00:01:05.240 --> 00:01:07.790
If anything happens, call me immediately.

00:01:12.900 --> 00:01:14.950
I'm so terribly sorry.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:17.820
It's not like you to apologize.

00:01:17.820 --> 00:01:19.930
Can you tell me what happened?

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:23.930
Terrorists tried to take you.

00:01:24.230 --> 00:01:26.510
Terrorists? Women?

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:27.720
Yes.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:33.690
We at UW distribute resources for 
everybody in the world but...

00:01:34.040 --> 00:01:38.320
Some people aren't happy 
that UW are in charge?

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.280
Correct.

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:41.830
Don't push!

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:47.560
Shouta-san!

00:01:49.570 --> 00:01:50.460
Girls...

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.970
Everybody was really worried!

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.790
Sorry for worrying you.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:02.470
Are you all okay?

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:07.660
Shouta-san!

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:08.980
Shouta-san!

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:10.780
I'm so glad you're okay!

00:03:46.280 --> 00:03:48.850
Is it okay for me to be outside?

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.700
They're after me, right?

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.260
A barrier?

00:04:01.260 --> 00:04:04.720
We had one around the school, too.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.710
But I guess there was a spy on the inside.

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:09.010
I'm so sorry.

00:04:09.690 --> 00:04:12.520
I'm glad nobody was really hurt.

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:19.280
I thought you hated Erika-san.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:25.660
Get down!

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.000
It was just reflex. That's all.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.200
You're a nice person.

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:38.030
But your body is <i>very</i> important!

00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:39.670
So don't act like that.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:45.510
Yeah. I'm the only guy in the 
world who's up and about.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:50.010
What?

00:04:50.450 --> 00:04:52.940
About that...

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:54.270
Actually...

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:59.250
There are four others?

00:05:01.560 --> 00:05:02.550
Yes.

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:05.240
Some haven't awoken yet.

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.280
But they all suffered 
from cellular sclerosis.

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.910
There are other men besides me?

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:20.590
They're in the way, aren't they?

00:05:23.600 --> 00:05:29.760
After this, I'm planning on having you 
leave Keimon and come to Tokyo with me.

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:31.330
Tokyo?

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:34.790
There's a UW World HQ 
messenger here right now.

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:37.960
Everything's a mess.

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.860
But instead of waiting for 
them to decide our fate,

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:46.700
I'd rather jump right into the 
thick of things and take the lead!

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:50.450
What are you after, exactly?

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:55.100
Somebody as smart as you's 
probably already figured it out.

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:57.500
But I'll just go ahead and tell you!

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:00.420
I want to be powerful and important!

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:04.840
Does that mean you want to 
be the head of Japan UW?

00:06:05.220 --> 00:06:06.130
Nope.

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:09.340
Number one in the whole world.

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:12.240
Number one in the whole world?

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:15.850
That's a big goal.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:21.990
And that's why I want you to be 
the number one man in the world!

00:06:23.520 --> 00:06:25.530
I told you this before.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:29.240
Your interests and mine are aligned, I think.

00:06:29.560 --> 00:06:33.140
You can tell me your plan later.

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:35.740
But tell me one thing first.

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:39.410
You never thought of being the 
first person to have my child?

00:06:40.790 --> 00:06:43.750
Shouta-sama, you know 
how soccer works, right?

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:46.240
I know the rules.

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:52.950
I'd rather be the coach telling everyone 
what to do instead of being a player.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:57.170
If you'd like to mate with me, 
I'm fine with that.

00:06:57.170 --> 00:07:01.900
But if I did have a child, 
I'd continue being your attendant.

00:07:07.590 --> 00:07:08.930
All right.

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:11.100
I'll help you with your ambitions.

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:32.430
Well?

00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:36.680
Sorry. I failed to get Number 3.

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.670
<i>It looks like they were watching out for us.</i>

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.930
<i>Don't take any more risks.</i>

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:44.180
Yeah, I'm going to leave Keimon.

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:45.810
What about your side?

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.740
<i>Currently in transport.</i>

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:58.950
We finally have him.

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:02.210
Our history is about to begin.

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:06.840
We will now begin the ritual of awakening!

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:12.750
Number 4... No! Our holy servant!

00:08:17.610 --> 00:08:19.720
To the Japan Branch Headquarters?

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:23.230
<i>Yes. You heard about the 
simultaneous terror attacks, right?</i>

00:08:23.590 --> 00:08:26.050
<i>Number 1 will be brought here temporarily.</i>

00:08:26.050 --> 00:08:27.730
<i>Make immediate preparations.</i>

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.480
<i>You, his attendants, will be coming, as well.</i>

00:08:30.820 --> 00:08:35.140
<i>Number 2 and Kuroda, as well 
as his bodyguard and nurse,</i>

00:08:35.140 --> 00:08:37.400
<i>are already here.</i>

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:41.840
<i>Oh, right. You, too, former attendant Suou.</i>

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:42.750
Yes, ma'am.

00:08:43.030 --> 00:08:45.250
Why is this coming from you, 
the Director-General,

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.000
and not the Public Welfare Director?

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:49.860
<i>I'll explain the details later.</i>

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:55.630
So the one who was kidnapped 
was the fourth man?

00:08:55.860 --> 00:09:03.000
Yes. The terrorists took advantage 
of us coming to Japan,

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.640
and simultaneously attacked 
multiple facilities.

00:09:06.180 --> 00:09:10.680
If the Japanese branch 
had told World HQ

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:14.650
that there were four men besides you, 
we could've stopped this.

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:19.250
What do the terrorists want?

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.910
We don't know for sure.

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:25.040
But most likely it's a reaction 
to the Japanese branch's tyranny.

00:09:25.040 --> 00:09:27.290
The Japanese branch aren't dictators!

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:30.290
Then why the terrorist attacks?

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:34.920
And Erisa's one of the terrorists?

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:36.000
Yes.

00:09:37.680 --> 00:09:41.680
Erisa Tachibana is one of 
their leaders, it appears.

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.190
What do we do now?

00:09:48.460 --> 00:09:52.940
Mizuhara-san, you're a very impressive man.

00:09:53.200 --> 00:09:55.940
You didn't give into the 
Japan branch's orders,

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:59.570
or help them in their unethical mating.

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:01.580
Is that why?

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:04.320
Number 1, Kyouji Hino,

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:08.500
mated with many unfortunate women who 
practically had no right to refuse.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:09.830
But not you.

00:10:09.830 --> 00:10:13.120
I thought Hino-san didn't sleep 
with any unwilling women...

00:10:14.350 --> 00:10:16.360
Don't worry.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:20.340
We'll ensure you're kept safe.

00:10:33.870 --> 00:10:37.400
<i>So everyone but Number 4 
is in your hands, then?</i>

00:10:37.400 --> 00:10:38.730
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:43.380
The mating plans for Number 1 
and 2 have been shut down.

00:10:43.380 --> 00:10:45.910
We know where Number 3 is.

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:50.920
Number 5 remains in cold 
sleep at a local facility.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:54.580
<i>Number 2, Reito Mizuhara, I understand.</i>

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:57.920
<i>But Number 1 agreed to stop mating, as well?</i>

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:01.960
He seemed unsatisfied, but for now, yes.

00:11:01.960 --> 00:11:06.180
<i>The profile we were given 
indicated he'd resist more.</i>

00:11:06.180 --> 00:11:08.540
<i>I wonder what changed his mind.</i>

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:13.190
Perhaps there's a girl he fell in love with?

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.940
<i>Be very careful in how you 
deal with the Numbers.</i>

00:11:24.440 --> 00:11:27.150
Utopia is almost here!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.930
Erisa, why did you become a terrorist?

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.340
<b>Mizuhara Reito Niigata Prefecture ▲▲ City</b>

00:11:40.970 --> 00:11:42.340
<b>Reito's pendant
The device's location information has been updated</b>

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:43.340
Niigata?

00:11:43.700 --> 00:11:45.990
<i>The pendant I gave Erisa...</i>

00:11:45.990 --> 00:11:49.140
<i>Until now it only said she 
was out of the country.</i>

00:11:51.030 --> 00:11:52.130
Damn it!

00:11:52.130 --> 00:11:54.770
I can't find out her specific 
location from here!

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.020
Akane-san!

00:11:58.320 --> 00:11:59.780
Can I come in?

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:01.160
We need to talk.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:06.350
Let's talk inside.

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:07.030
Wait.

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:17.540
Now we can make sure nobody can hear us.

00:12:20.050 --> 00:12:21.590
I don't mind.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:26.460
Hello!

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:28.710
How are you doing?

00:12:31.840 --> 00:12:33.310
What do you want?

00:12:33.630 --> 00:12:36.400
Sorry for sticking you in this tiny room.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:38.880
The situation is chaotic right now.

00:12:38.880 --> 00:12:42.190
Please stay here until things calm down.

00:12:42.530 --> 00:12:47.710
I heard about the terrorists and World 
HQ, and all the stuff that's going on.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:50.830
But the other girls, the ones who 
aren't here, are safe, right?

00:12:51.170 --> 00:12:52.560
Of course.

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:56.600
UW World HQ is an ally to women everywhere.

00:12:57.210 --> 00:13:03.340
That said, why is there a girl 
besides Isurugi-san in this room?

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:06.080
Kitayama-chan takes care of me—

00:13:06.080 --> 00:13:06.970
No.

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.160
No exceptions.

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:14.230
As I explained, all contact 
with you must go through us.

00:13:14.490 --> 00:13:20.360
Your food, your baths, this is 
necessary to keep you healthy.

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:24.610
Don't think that every man is 
going to do what you want him to!

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:37.890
I want to tell you about my mother Kihara, 
the National Affairs Director.

00:13:38.700 --> 00:13:44.130
The directors are going to be put on trial 
for the crime of manufacturing the MK Virus.

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:47.380
Were they really the ones who did it?

00:13:47.740 --> 00:13:52.700
I dislike her, but she wouldn't do that.

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.770
And I can't trust that Chloe girl.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:14:00.720
My mother was always such a 
hardworking, honest person.

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:05.750
She prioritized work over 
her husband or family.

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:08.200
I see.

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:15.000
Akane-san!

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:17.670
I had a younger brother...

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:20.500
until five years ago.

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:26.010
She didn't even attend his funeral.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:32.510
She was busy doing everything she could 
to help this country face the pandemic.

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:40.180
Let's talk to Director Kihara.

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:43.270
I'll ask Chloe to make it happen.

00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:52.660
T-T-Trouble!

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:57.120
<i>Hello, everyone around the world.</i>

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.040
<i>I am broadcasting this from Japan.</i>

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:01.370
Erisa?

00:15:01.720 --> 00:15:04.020
Is this who you were looking for?

00:15:04.640 --> 00:15:05.880
How...?

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.380
Sh-She hijacked the airwaves!

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:11.180
We are not terrorists.

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:16.140
We are a group who will free 
the world from UW rule.

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.180
Izanami.

00:15:19.070 --> 00:15:20.520
Izanami?

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:26.020
<i>That's Erisa. I knew it!</i>

00:15:26.370 --> 00:15:29.680
<i>UW says its job is to 
bring order to the world.</i>

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:32.580
<i>But it's full of liars and hypocrites!</i>

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:35.030
<i>We'll show you proof.</i>

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:39.410
His name is Kinebuchi Zen. A man.

00:15:40.700 --> 00:15:43.540
Th-That's... Number 4!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:47.120
<i>Just like Mizuhara... Reito.</i>

00:15:47.120 --> 00:15:49.800
<i>He is another man who can 
survive outside cold sleep.</i>

00:15:52.970 --> 00:16:01.560
<i>The women who rule the world at UW 
kept his and others' existence hidden.</i>

00:16:01.890 --> 00:16:08.070
<i>And we have proof of another 
criminal act by UW.</i>

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:10.570
<i>Look at this.</i>

00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:16.570
<i>These are the remains of satellites, 
abandoned in a factory somewhere in the world.</i>

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:22.360
<i>High concentrations of the MK Virus 
were found on one of their parts.</i>

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:23.580
<i>The amount was unbelievably high.</i>

00:16:24.160 --> 00:16:32.590
<i>And the president of the company 
is now one of the leaders of UW.</i>

00:16:32.970 --> 00:16:34.840
<i>What does this mean?</i>

00:16:35.530 --> 00:16:38.480
<i>It's highly likely that the 
current leadership of UW</i>

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:42.350
<i>are the ones who spread the 
MK Virus around the world.</i>

00:16:43.690 --> 00:16:51.020
<i>UW are trying to eliminate all men and 
create a world comprised only of women!</i>

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:54.960
UW's leaders created the virus?

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:56.100
Is that true?

00:16:56.650 --> 00:16:58.620
I can't believe it, either!

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:01.680
<i>UW are already investing 
huge resources in America</i>

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:05.620
<i>into creating a way to give birth 
to children using only female genes.</i>

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:10.470
<i>Their plan to create a world comprised only of 
women is getting closer and closer to reality.</i>

00:17:19.730 --> 00:17:23.390
We at Izanami demand that the four 
men, including Mizuhara Reito,

00:17:23.670 --> 00:17:30.900
<i>as well as all men in cold sleep under 
UW control, be turned over to us.</i>

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:36.400
<i>If there are any men near you in cold 
sleep, protect them at all costs.</i>

00:17:36.760 --> 00:17:37.710
Brother...

00:17:38.450 --> 00:17:41.160
A world without men would be wrong.

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:44.450
Women of the world, rise up!

00:17:50.000 --> 00:17:52.670
<i>The members of Izanami will now...</i>

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:54.250
<i>Are we ready?</i>

00:17:53.170 --> 00:18:01.930
<b>Terrorists have hijacked our airwaves. 
Beware of terrorist activities.</b>

00:17:53.170 --> 00:18:01.930
<b>Breaking
News</b>

00:17:54.250 --> 00:17:56.790
<i>I'm terribly sorry, everyone.</i>

00:17:56.790 --> 00:17:59.400
<i>The terrorists had hijacked the airwaves,</i>

00:17:59.400 --> 00:18:01.930
<i>but we restored things to their proper state.</i>

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:07.340
<i>Do not be deceived by their 
disinformation, and remain calm.</i>

00:18:12.760 --> 00:18:16.190
Can you explain that broadcast?

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:19.540
The Japanese summer sure is hot!

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:21.200
Don't change the subject!

00:18:21.500 --> 00:18:24.590
If our goal was the destruction of all men,

00:18:24.590 --> 00:18:27.460
you'd be long dead by now, right?

00:18:27.720 --> 00:18:32.840
I'm known worldwide. 
You might want to kill me last.

00:18:34.310 --> 00:18:40.840
So has even one of the men in 
cold sleep died since we arrived?

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:45.370
I understand your desire to believe 
the words of your old lover,

00:18:45.370 --> 00:18:51.350
but Erisa Tachibana is one of the 
terrorists who stole Number 4 by force.

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:52.720
Well...

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:05.710
I'm feeling so hot, 
I'm going to take a shower.

00:19:05.710 --> 00:19:10.060
Why don't you join me?

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:12.250
I'll be going!

00:19:20.050 --> 00:19:21.660
<i>Just as planned.</i>

00:19:21.660 --> 00:19:24.050
<i>No problems with the Japan branch?</i>

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:26.430
Everyone's a little on edge,

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:29.120
but the Japanese are an obedient people.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:30.980
There's no problem at all.

00:19:31.430 --> 00:19:32.310
What about you?

00:19:32.560 --> 00:19:34.690
<i>Izanami, was it?</i>

00:19:34.690 --> 00:19:40.700
<i>Their broadcast is being completely blacked 
out from the media on our side of the world.</i>

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:43.200
Our control of information is complete, then.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:49.300
<i>Our brainwashing of our staff and the 
women in leadership roles is complete.</i>

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:51.560
<i>The plan is working just fine.</i>

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:55.800
<i>Again, be extremely careful in 
how you deal with the Numbers.</i>

00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:58.210
<i>Especially Reito Mizuhara.</i>

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:00.020
Yes, ma'am.

00:20:04.380 --> 00:20:06.840
Wh-What do we do now?

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:07.810
I don't know.

00:20:08.120 --> 00:20:10.810
I have to get to Erisa somehow.

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:22.140
I'm amazed you were able to get in here.

00:20:22.140 --> 00:20:24.320
A lot's happened, and things 
outside are a mess right now.

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:28.080
We were able to get in with all the chaos.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:32.830
A civilian organization 
is rebelling against UW?

00:20:33.280 --> 00:20:34.960
You're sharp, huh?

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:39.600
Thinking back, UW World HQ probably came now

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.970
because they knew it was about to happen.

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:50.610
I hate to say it, but that means their network 
of spies here in Japan exceeded our own.

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:56.760
Sorry, but I'm not here to help you.

00:20:56.760 --> 00:20:58.160
I have a question.

00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:03.320
