00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:28.020
Somebody's inside.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.510
It might be Chloe's soldiers.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:43.650
You're here!

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:46.280
<i>A teenager? Who is he?</i>

00:21:47.550 --> 00:21:49.780
Mizuhara Reito-san, correct?

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:51.530
Yes.

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:54.290
Hello.

00:21:55.240 --> 00:21:59.040
I'm Number 3. Doi Shouta.

